-    *   $\bar{\sigma}_c^2$: Pre-Softplus variance prediction for color (scalar).
-*   **Ray Sampling:** A set of $N$ points $\{t_i\}_{i=1}^N$ along the ray $r(t) = \mathbf{o} + t\mathbf{d}$, where $\mathbf{o}$ is the camera center. $\delta_i = t_{i+1} - t_i$.
